{"read_id": "READ-20261103-fec826", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-addc72"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "§2-1。第V書板の自責とコロフォンを Foster 訳から引用。自認の直後に「一行も足さなかった」が来る順序を読んだ。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-3b3911", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-44ef43"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "§2-2。「今日、誰に語れようか」の反復と、川岸で死んだ者・碑文の破壊・死後の同居の申し出を引用。反復回数16は英訳見出し単位。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-100f75", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-9bee4b"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "§2-3。`puruṣo vāva sukṛtam`、飢えと渇きの `bhāginyau`、食物を掴む `apāna`、`atha ko'ham iti`、`sīmānaṃ vidārya`／`vidṛti` を引用。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-77523e", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-94624e"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "§2-4。v.12–13 の「同じ目的なのに何が違いを生んだか」と v.32–33 の「知識・信・正しい行いが解脱の真の原因」を引用。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-2fb702", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-1d39db"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "§2-5。`不說一字`・`非不隨義巧說言詞`・指と物・指と月の偈を漢文で引用し、一字ずつ照合した。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-3fc64d", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-76334e"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "§2-6。ミシュナ4:10 の `ona'at devarim`、`לֹא בַשָּׁמַיִם הִיא`、`נִצְּחוּנִי בָּנַי`、結びの `חוץ משערי אונאה` を引用。引用範囲を58bから59b結びまで広げた。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-269e03", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-535640"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "§2-7。矛盾する `ego eimi` の列挙、沈黙と観念の対、`I am the utterance of my name` を引用。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-e14c7b", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-c7e890"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "§2-8。ザイドの二つのアラビア語句（前例のなさ／山を運ぶより重い）、材料の三語、第九章末尾二節の一人証言、三人の保管者を引用。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-978408", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-fabe33"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "§2-9。心・形・物の空、`觀空亦空`、`雖名得道，實無所得`、葛玄の跋 `口口相傳，不記文字` を漢文で引用。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-73a8f0", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-4885ac"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "§2-10。祖神の巡行、`新粟初嘗、家内諱忌`、`是以福慈岳常雪不得登臨`、`其筑波岳往集歌舞飲喫、至于今不絶也` を漢文で引用。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-7cc60d", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-5914e0"}, "reading": "quoted", "note": "§2-11。`Por medio del intérprete respondemos`、`déjennos pues morir`、`la antigua regla de vida`、`no creemos aún` を引用。媒体の名乗りと、征服者の筆という二重の来歴を読んだ。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-f03f3d", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-21c881"}, "reading": "summarized", "note": "§2-12。原書未照合のため直接引用せず、レグバの領地なし・「マウの言語学者」・ガバドゥの十六の目と palm nuts を要約として記した。12件中唯一の二次要約であることを明記。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-e69b9d", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-620ee5"}, "reading": "reinterpreted", "note": "§0-2 と §2-11。同日に別セッションが収蔵した「モーセの死を書いたのは誰か」を、媒介者の欄という本稿の軸から読み直した。新規素材にはしない。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-6e80e1", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-fdb87d"}, "reading": "reinterpreted", "note": "§0-2 と §3-1。八列目の後ろで理解できないモーセを、運び手の位置の先例として読んだ。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-aad9a1", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-68b161"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "§0-2。問い返されなかった小小戒（応答の不在）を、`Q-20261103-32a3cd` の既存の型として参照した。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-4a9d4e", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-8985cf"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "§0-2。問答の媒介（通訳）という主題で『コルキオス』と並べ、新規素材にはしなかった。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-a9cc1b", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-11292c"}, "reading": "reinterpreted", "note": "§0-2 と §2-12。イファの籤が選んだ一節を唱える者を、レグバが開いたファの書き物の後続として読んだ（同一視はしない）。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-209b9a", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-98fec7"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "§0-2。ハディース形式の収蔵は本稿のブハーリー4986で足りると判断した際の比較対象。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-299b21", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-40efa0"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "§0-2。メソアメリカは既収蔵が厚いため、『コルキオス』との対比は参照で足りるとした。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-8ddbde", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-6a599a"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "§0-2。アイヌ神謡の口承・歌唱の媒介を、筑波郡条の一夜の饗応と並べて参照した。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-c3e41c", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261031-466f30"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "§0-2。聞き・熟考し・選ぶ構造を、媒介の軸から外した理由の記録として読んだ。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-914f6d", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-dbc4e7"}, "reading": "reinterpreted", "note": "§0-2 と §2-1。声調を一つ違えた呪言を、エッラの「一行も足さなかった」の反例として読んだ。書き写しの誤りが実効を持つ伝統がある。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-ef9664", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-706557"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "§0-2。既収蔵のゾロアスター教資料として、12件の枠から外した理由を確認した。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-00839a", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261031-3e078c"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "§0-2。運搬・帰還の物語として本稿の媒介の主題に近いが、既収蔵のため参照で足りるとした。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-e86ff3", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261103-4ce881"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "§0-2。言葉の害と時機（MN 58）を、ババ・メツィア58b の `ona'at devarim` と並べて参照した。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261103-cc684a", "session_id": "SESSION-20261103-b115a2", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-f85896"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "§0-2。ナグ・ハマディは本稿で VI,2 を選んだため、II,2 の『トマス福音書』は参照に回した。", "created_at": "2026-11-03"}
